  "description": {
   "en": "Yan Yongqing, once an elite adventurer, faces betrayal by the Light Angel at the brink of victory, leading to his team's demise. Reborn with a Demon Lord System, he starts anew, rising from Level 1 to lead a terrifying army of demons! With top-tier demons like Satan and Lucifer at his command, it's time to turn the tables on the angels and claim his vengeance."
